

# ── Commit message guide (lines starting with # are ignored) ──────────────
#
# Format:   <type>(<optional scope>): <short summary in imperative mood>
#
# Examples:
#   feat(weather-cli): add 7-day forecast command
#   fix(portfolio-site): correct broken link on contact page
#   docs: explain how to run the tests
#
# Types:
#   feat      new feature              fix       bug fix
#   docs      documentation only       style     formatting, no logic change
#   refactor  code change, same behavior   perf  performance improvement
#   test      add or fix tests         build     dependencies, packaging
#   ci        GitHub Actions           chore     maintenance, tooling
#
# Rules: summary ≤ 72 chars, no trailing period. Use the body (after a blank
# line) to explain WHAT changed and WHY. Reference issues: "Closes #12".
